 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Communication Stack Types (ComStack_Types)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Standardized types, PDU identifiers, lengths, and buffer request types (PduIdType, PduLengthType, PduInfoType, BufReq_ReturnType) used across all communication layers.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type is used within the entire AUTOSAR Com Stack except for bus drivers.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00008\">PduLengthType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type shall be used within the entire AUTOSAR Com Stack of an ECU except for bus drivers.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Variables of this type shall be used to store the basic information about a PDU of any type, namely a pointer variable...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00036\">PNCHandleType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Used to store the identifier of a partial network cluster.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00031\">TPParameterType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Specify the parameter to which the value has to be changed (BS or STmin).</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00012\">BufReq_ReturnType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Variables of this type shall be used to store the result of a buffer request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00027\">TpDataStateType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Variables of this type shall be used to store the state of TP buffer.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00037\">RetryInfoType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Variables of this type shall be used to store the information about Tp buffer handling.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00038\">NetworkHandleType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Variables of the type Network Handle Type shall be used to store the identifier of a communication channel.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2 class=\"sect\">Typen — Detailansicht</h2>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00005\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> PduIdType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00005\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00005]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00005)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type is used within the entire AUTOSAR Com Stack except for bus drivers.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00008\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> PduLengthType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00008\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00008]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00008)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00008\">PduLengthType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type shall be used within the entire AUTOSAR Com Stack of an ECU except for bus drivers.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00011\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> PduInfoType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00011\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00011]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00011, S. 19)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef struct { <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* SduDataPtr; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* MetaDataPtr; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00008\">PduLengthType</a> SduLength; } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Variables of this type shall be used to store the basic information about a PDU of any type, namely a pointer variable pointing to its SDU (payload), a pointer to Meta Data of the PDU, and the corresponding length of the SDU in byt es.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00036\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> PNCHandleType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00036\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00036]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00036\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00036)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00036\">PNCHandleType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Used to store the identifier of a partial network cluster.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00031\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> TPParameterType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00031\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00031]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00031\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00031, S. 18)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef enum { TP_STMIN, TP_BS, TP_BC } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00031\">TPParameterType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Specify the parameter to which the value has to be changed (BS or STmin).</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00012\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> BufReq_ReturnType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00012\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00012]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00012\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00012)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef enum { BUFREQ_OK, BUFREQ_E_NOT_OK, BUFREQ_E_BUSY, BUFREQ_E_OVFL } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00012\">BufReq_ReturnType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Variables of this type shall be used to store the result of a buffer request.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00027\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> TpDataStateType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00027\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00027]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00027, S. 21)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef enum { TP_DATACONF, TP_DATARETRY, TP_CONFPENDING } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00027\">TpDataStateType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Variables of this type shall be used to store the state of TP buffer.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00037\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> RetryInfoType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00037\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00037]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00037\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00037)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef struct { <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00027\">TpDataStateType</a> TpDataState; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00008\">PduLengthType</a> TxTpDataCnt; } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00037\">RetryInfoType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Variables of this type shall be used to store the information about Tp buffer handling.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_COMTYPE_00038\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> NetworkHandleType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_COMTYPE_00038\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_COMTYPE_00038]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_COMTYPE_00038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CommunicationStackTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_COMTYPE_00038, S. 22)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_COMTYPE_00038\">NetworkHandleType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Variables of the type Network Handle Type shall be used to store the identifier of a communication channel.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
 ]
